WEBVTT

00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:31.903
our teacher would tell
everyone to line up,

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:33.446
and I would immediately line up

00:00:33.446 --> 00:00:35.448
and then I would look
at all the other kids

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.783
who were still goofing off,

00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:38.785
and I would think, "What are they doing?

00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:40.912
Did they not hear her,
she said to line up."

00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:44.582
I rinsed my mouth with mouthwash
for at least 30 seconds every night,

00:00:44.624 --> 00:00:49.003
because on the label, it says
"Use for 30 seconds."

00:00:49.879 --> 00:00:52.090
I know, I'm irritated by me, too.

00:00:52.131 --> 00:00:53.883
(Laughter)

00:00:53.883 --> 00:00:57.804
But the real reason
that I became interested in ethics

00:00:57.804 --> 00:00:59.430
is because in 2005,

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:02.892
I royally and epically
screwed something up.